COMPOUNDING INSIGHT:
  Fact 2 improvements are POSITIVELY CORRELATED with the product.
  Speed sets with more Fact 2 improvement have larger products
  (more lonely time). The improvement compounds through the cascade.

  AP has ZERO Fact 2 improvement → minimum product (tightest).
  Non-AP has POSITIVE improvement → larger product (easier LRC).

  This is the MECHANISM behind the resonance debt conjecture:
  AP maximizes the debt (no Fact 2 bonus) while non-AP
  gets a Fact 2 discount on the debt.

======================================================================
SYNTHESIS: The two facts of the cascade
======================================================================

THE CASCADE AS A PRODUCT OF CONDITIONAL CLEARANCES:
  P(lonely) = Π_k P_k

FACT 1 (FORWARD PROPAGATION):
  If runners 1..k are safe AND the feasible set wraps for runner k+1,
  then P_{k+1} > 0 (runner k+1 can be cleared).
  This is the IMAGE-WRAPPING condition from S527.
  It gives: P_k ≥ (n-2)/n (roughly) — the cascade continues.

FACT 2 (CYCLE EXCLUSION):
  If runner k is safe, certain CYCLE-CREATING configurations of
  the remaining runners are EXCLUDED. Specifically:
    runner k safe ⟹ ¬(runner j blocks ∧ runner l resonates to form k→j→l→k)
  This exclusion IMPROVES P_{k+1} above (n-2)/n.

THE TWO FACTS TOGETHER:
  Fact 1 guarantees the cascade CONTINUES (product > 0).
  Fact 2 guarantees the cascade IMPROVES for non-AP (product > credit).

  For AP: Fact 2 is SILENT (max coherence, cycles minimal).
    → product = credit exactly → minimum product → tightest case.
  For non-AP: Fact 2 is ACTIVE (cycles present, exclusion beneficial).
    → product > credit → larger lonely measure → easier LRC.

  The RESONANCE DEBT CONJECTURE (HYP-2009) follows:
    debt/credit ≤ 1 because Fact 2 provides a non-negative bonus,
    and the bonus is zero ONLY for AP (equality case).

THE HIDDEN FACT IN THE TILING MODEL:
  Tile (X,Y) aligned ⟹ ¬(tile (Z,X) anti-aligned ∧ tile (Y,Z) anti-aligned)
  This is the CYCLE EXCLUSION in tile space: aligning one tile
  constrains the other tiles through the directed cycle structure.
  The tiling model makes this dependence VISIBLE — it's the
  reason tiles are not independent binary variables.

